  m_Name: unit_820888
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Inara, the Deluge
  unitId: 820888
  unitNumber: 8640
  description: "In an age far removed from dragons and deities, Inara\u2014the name
    assigned to the subject of this experiment\u2014is truly a legend in living flesh.
    Reconstructed with mysterious technology analogous to that of other highly-developed
    worlds, this artificial manifestation of a violent goddess of eld replicates
    to near-perfect accuracy her power whispered of in serpentine tongues.It is said
    that the great corpse in the deepest reaches of what ancient sources called the
    Endless Abyss harbored within itself lingering life, and it was with this in
    mind that the researchers selected a biological shell to encourage its growth.
    All candidates were carefully fielded and systematically erased of personal identity.
    Whoever this woman was before Inara was of no concern to her keepers.Inara's
    sole companion is the loyal serpent Vishap. Though merely a technologically clever
    approximation of ancient magic, Vishap nevertheless possesses the capability
    for meaningful thought and speech. Scattered research notes imply he may have
    been derived from a source said to be extremely close to the original goddess.For
    reasons yet undiscovered, the project was abandoned before Inara was able to
    remember her awakenings, suggesting that she was an induced amnesiac while under
    stasis in the facility. Upon leaving her cradle for the first time, Inara wrestled
    with memories false and new flooding her senses.She would not have to wait long,
    however, before a certain resonance with an entity beyond the stars would threaten
    her rule in the realm bequeathed to her. With Vishap's hissing advice in her
    ears, Inara bided her time in observation of this foolish challenger..."
  summonDesc: What came before me was a failure.<br>But even that has its own merits.<br>I
    will not make the same mistakes twice.
  fusionDesc: Hah. As if writhing hunger defines me.<br>I am above such base desires.
  evoDesc: "Goddess, I am called\u2014<br>Yet so much is denied to me;<br>Even the
    thought of it, erased. Unknown."
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
